 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "grid is a non-empty rectangular matrix of 0 (healthy) and 1 (infected) and threshold is an integer from 1 to 8. Each day, every healthy plant with at least threshold infected plants among its up to 8 neighbours (diagonals included) becomes infected, all at once, using the state at the start of the day; infected plants stay infected. Day d is the d-th such update; initially infected plants have infection day 0. Return a matrix holding each plant's infection day, or -1 for a plant that is never infected.",
